{
 "translation": "Bishan Singh stood silently. Fazaldeen began to speak. \"He had told me to keep asking about your well-being. Now I have heard that you are going to Hindustan. Give my regards to Bhai Balbir Singh and Bhai Badhawa Singh, and also to Behan Amrit Kaur. Tell Bhai Balbir that Fazaldeen is well and happy. One of the two brown buffaloes they left behind has given birth to a calf. The other had also given birth, but that one died after six days. And tell him that whatever service I can render, I am always ready. And for you, I have brought these few maroondas.\"",
